The public source does not include complete compiled Protun build inputs.
This package carries Proton's authenticated 5.8.11 amd64 archive as a pinned
upstream component and preserves its compiled networking payload byte-for-byte.

rebuild_overlay.py verifies vendor control scripts and the complete payload,
then applies four pinned patches to six declared Python files. The unchanged boot unit is installed under the
canonical /usr/lib/systemd/system path with its mode/hash verified. Protun's
system-owned transient secret behavior comes from Proton and is behavior-tested.
The disabled boot-unit default, saved enablement and final-removal behavior are
preserved. See overlay-manifest.json for exact inputs and changed-file hashes.
